<cl=00FF00>ENTRANCE TO THE CASTLE<br>
<br>
<cl=FFFFFF>The castle has private rooms (the key can be obtained from the tablet), a treasury, a teleport, a dungeon and much more.<br>
The castle can be improved by paying the fee at the tablet, by transferring the required amount of thalers in advance from the inventory to the tablet.<br>
The castle is the greatest value for the clan that will protect it if you suddenly decide to attack. The castle is also guarded by monsters. beware if you come with bad intentions.
<br>
<l="hts:\\language\helpindex.hts">Full help for the game (F1)<\l><br>
}